2,Somba-Siawari Language (BMU)... | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/bmu/,Somba-Siawari is a stable indigenous language of Papua New Guinea. It belongs to the Trans-New Guinea language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community.,Somba-Siawari,Trans-New Guinea
